Error: Jet.UnknownCallingConvention: `vectorcall` is not a known C calling convention
  --> Tests/UI/cffi_abi_unknown.jet:4:10
    |
  4 |     #ABI(vectorcall) ping: fn(x: I32) -> I32 = "ping"
    |          ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `#ABI` accepts only the ratified native ABI names
 Fix: Use `system`, `cdecl`, `stdcall`, `fastcall`, `win64`, or `sysv64`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.UnknownCallingConvention
